WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.192
Week seven established pregnancy physiology and maternal emergencies. Here we use that foundation for the two obstetric sections of seven E, especially trauma and red-flag assessment.
第七周已建立妊娠生理及母体急症基础。这里把基础用于7E两节产科内容，重点是创伤与红旗评估。

00:00:12.192 --> 00:00:24.816
The immediate task remains recognition and treatment of airway, breathing, circulation and neurological threats. A detailed pregnancy history follows rather than delays essential care.
即时任务仍是识别并处理气道、呼吸、循环及神经威胁。详细孕史应随后采集，而非延误必要照护。

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:35.736
Connect each modification to a reason: less respiratory reserve, potential hidden blood loss, uterine compression or a symptom that needs obstetric evaluation.
每项调整都应连到理由，例如呼吸储备较少、可能隐匿失血、子宫压迫，或需产科评估的症状。

00:00:35.736 --> 00:00:47.640
This session does not complete normal birth or neonatal resuscitation. Those practical sequences are taught separately so maternal and newborn decisions are not mixed into one algorithm.
本节不代表完成正常分娩或新生儿复苏。它们会独立教学，避免把母体与新生儿决定混成一个算法。

00:00:47.640 --> 00:01:01.296
Ask the estimated gestation, how it was established and whether more than one fetus is expected. If the information is uncertain, preserve that uncertainty rather than turn an estimate into a confirmed date.
应问估计孕周、依据及是否多胎。资料不确定时应保留不确定，而非把估计变成确认日期。

00:01:01.296 --> 00:01:14.472
Clarify pain, vaginal bleeding, fluid loss, contractions and fetal movement when relevant. Record when each change began rather than combine all symptoms under pregnant and unwell.
相关时需澄疼痛、阴道出血、流液、宫缩及胎动，并分别记起始，不能都归作怀孕不舒服。

00:01:14.472 --> 00:01:26.664
Ask about prior deliveries, cesarean or other uterine surgery and significant complications. The current pregnancy counts in gravida; the number of living children is a different item.
需问既往分娩、剖宫产或其他子宫手术及重要并发。当前妊娠计入孕次，现存子女数则是不同项目。

00:01:26.664 --> 00:01:39.048
Ask about medicines, medical conditions, recent birth or pregnancy loss and the specific injury mechanism. Do not assume pregnancy is absent simply because it is not visible.
应问药物、疾病、近期分娩或妊娠丢失及具体受伤机制。不能因看不出腹部增大就假定没有妊娠。

00:01:39.048 --> 00:01:51.192
The school describes substantial blood-volume expansion. Plasma increases more than red-cell mass, so dilution and greater circulating volume are related but different concepts.
学校描述血容量显著增加。血浆增加多于红细胞总量，因此稀释及循环量增加相关，却并非同一概念。

00:01:51.192 --> 00:02:02.640
A pregnant patient can have important blood loss before a dramatic fall in pressure. Do not use a percentage such as thirty percent as a safe loss allowance or a prediction for an individual.
孕妇可能在血压明显下降前已有重要失血。不能把百分之三十等数字当安全可失额度或个体预测。

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:15.528
Placental perfusion depends on maternal circulation and can be compromised while maternal vital signs still appear compensated. A reassuring initial pressure does not clear the fetus or the injury.
胎盘灌注依赖母体循环，母体生命体征仍像代偿时就可能受损。首次血压令人放心，不能排除胎儿或伤情问题。

00:02:15.528 --> 00:02:27.888
Seek the mechanism, pain, tenderness, bleeding, perfusion and trajectory. Treat current threats and organize appropriate definitive assessment rather than wait for classic shock.
需查机制、疼痛、压痛、出血、灌注及趋势，处理当前威胁并安排适当明确评估，不能等经典休克齐全。

00:02:27.888 --> 00:02:40.320
Pregnancy can lower systemic vascular resistance and increase pulse and cardiac output. These adaptations vary with gestation and do not supply one normal value for every patient.
妊娠可降低全身血管阻力，并增加脉率及心输出。适应随孕期变化，不能给人人一个正常值。

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:52.392
Compare with a reliable individual baseline while assessing present perfusion and symptoms. A large relative change can be important without being a standalone diagnosis.
需与可靠个体基线比，同时评当前灌注症状。较大相对变化可重要，但不是独立诊断。

00:02:52.392 --> 00:03:05.088
Do not dismiss marked tachycardia, hypotension, chest pain, syncope or new dyspnea as normal pregnancy. These findings require explanation in the current clinical context.
不能把显著快率、低压、胸痛、晕厥或新气促都叫正常妊娠。需在当前情境中解释这些发现。

00:03:05.088 --> 00:03:17.424
Conversely, the school phrase normal adult pressure may be dangerous does not redefine pregnancy hypertension. We will keep diagnostic thresholds separate from symptoms and relative change.
反过来，学校所说成人正常血压也可危险，并不会重新定义妊娠高血压。后面会把诊断阈值与症状、相对变化分开。

00:03:17.424 --> 00:03:30.648
Pregnancy increases oxygen demand while anatomical changes can reduce the reserve available during interrupted breathing. Prepare airway and ventilation support early when the patient is critically ill.
妊娠增加氧需求，解剖变化又可减少呼吸中断时的储备。危重时需及早准备气道与通气支持。

00:03:30.648 --> 00:03:42.720
Minute ventilation often rises through increased tidal volume. Do not confuse liters per minute with breaths per minute or assume a large new respiratory-rate increase is physiological.
分钟通气常通过潮气量增加而上升。不能混淆每分钟升与每分钟次数，也不能把明显新快呼吸假定为生理性。

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:54.384
Assess breathing directly and check reliable measurements. A pulse-oximeter value cannot establish airway protection, adequate carbon-dioxide clearance or fetal well-being.
需直接评呼吸并查可靠测量。指夹血氧不能证明气道保护、充分排二氧化碳或胎儿健康。

00:03:54.384 --> 00:04:06.408
Treat inadequate breathing through the appropriate authorized pathway. Oxygen alone is not a substitute for ventilation, and a normal initial number does not prevent later deterioration.
呼吸不足需依适当授权路径处理。给氧不能替代通气，最初数字正常也不能阻止后来恶化。

00:04:06.408 --> 00:04:15.912
The school highlights vascular and edematous airway tissues. These can bleed with traumatic manipulation and can complicate airway access.
学校强调气道组织血管充盈及水肿。创伤性操作可使其出血，并增加气道接近困难。

00:04:15.912 --> 00:04:29.184
Use effective basic airway maneuvers and suitable authorized equipment, with suction and assistance ready. Gentle handling means careful effective care, not avoiding necessary life-saving support.
应使用有效基本气道手法及合适授权器械，并准备吸引和协助。轻柔是谨慎有效，不是回避必要救命支持。

00:04:29.184 --> 00:04:41.568
Do not choose every device one size smaller or stop all airway care merely because bleeding appears. Reassess the problem, clear obstruction appropriately and escalate within training and scope.
不能所有器械都一律小一号，也不能一见出血就停止全部气道照护。需重评问题、适当清除阻塞，并依训练权限升级。

00:04:41.568 --> 00:04:53.256
Advanced intubation remains an appropriately trained provider's intervention. The assessment lesson does not authorize a PCP to perform it or delay useful bag-mask ventilation.
高级插管仍属适当训练者操作。本评估课不授权PCP插管，也不能延误有效囊罩通气。

00:04:53.256 --> 00:05:09.792
Reduced lower-esophageal-sphincter tone and increased abdominal pressure contribute to aspiration risk. Labour and opioids can slow gastric emptying; pregnancy alone does not uniformly cause the delayed-emptying rule stated in the school section.
食管下括约肌张力低及腹压增加可助误吸。分娩及阿片可减慢胃排空，但妊娠本身不普遍符合学校所说一律排空延迟。

00:05:09.792 --> 00:05:22.560
Prepare airway protection and suction according to the condition. A routine nasogastric tube is not a guaranteed aspiration-prevention measure or an independently authorized PCP action.
应依状态准备气道保护及吸引。常规胃管不是保证预防误吸，也不自动成为PCP独立获准操作。

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:35.064
Renal blood flow and filtration rise during pregnancy and laboratory interpretation can change. That does not mean every medicine is cleared faster or every dose should be increased.
妊娠肾血流及滤过增加，化验解释可改变。但不代表所有药清除更快，或所有剂量都应增加。

00:05:35.064 --> 00:05:48.552
Use the relevant medicine monograph, indication, pregnancy cautions and consultation requirements. A mechanism explains why careful prescribing matters, not permission to invent a dose adjustment.
需依相关药物条目、适应证、妊娠注意及会诊要求。机制解释为何谨慎用药重要，不授权自行调整剂量。

00:05:48.552 --> 00:05:59.640
The fetus depends on maternal oxygenation and circulation. Treating maternal life threats is not a choice to ignore the fetus; it is the immediate way to support both.
胎儿依赖母体氧合循环。处理母体生命威胁，不是选择忽视胎儿，而是即时支持双方的方法。

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:10.656
Control external bleeding, support effective breathing and manage perfusion through the appropriate pathway. Do not delay these tasks to obtain a fetal heart-rate measurement.
需控外出血、支持有效呼吸，并依适当路径处理灌注。不能为取胎心测量而延误这些任务。

00:06:10.656 --> 00:06:22.632
Add pregnancy-specific positioning and thermal protection without losing necessary injury care. Adaptations should improve the primary plan, not create a separate competing checklist.
需增加孕期体位及保温，但不能丢必要伤情照护。调整应改善主要计划，而不是另造竞争清单。

00:06:22.632 --> 00:06:34.080
Request additional help early when maternal and newborn care or difficult extraction may require separate teams. Pre-alert the receiving service with the mechanism and clinical concerns.
可能需母体与新生儿分队或困难脱困时，应及早增援，并以机制及临床担忧向接收方预警。

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:45.576
Describe the actual mechanism instead of only saying minor collision or simple fall. Ask where force was applied, whether the abdomen was compressed and when symptoms began.
应描述真实机制，不只称小碰撞或简单跌倒。需问力作用部位、腹部是否受压及症状何时起。

00:06:45.576 --> 00:06:58.800
The enlarged uterus is more exposed outside the pelvis, and placental injury may occur without a dramatic external wound. Musculoskeletal adaptations can also change balance and injury patterns.
增大子宫在骨盆外更暴露，胎盘伤可没有明显外伤口。肌骨适应也可改变平衡及受伤模式。

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:13.248
Seek new abdominal pain, tenderness, contractions, bleeding or fluid loss and movement changes. Absence of any one symptom does not reliably clear the pregnancy after significant trauma.
需找新腹痛、压痛、宫缩、出血或流液及胎动变。缺任何单项，都不能可靠排除重要创伤后的妊娠问题。

00:07:13.248 --> 00:07:25.272
Use appropriate trauma evaluation and destination planning. A patient's initial reassurance is valuable history but does not replace clinical assessment or obstetric review when indicated.
应安排适当创伤评估及目的地。患者初始觉得没事是有用病史，却不能替代有适应证的临床或产科复核。

00:07:25.272 --> 00:07:34.656
Placental abruption involves separation of the placenta from its attachment before birth. Trauma is one context in which it must be considered.
胎盘早剥是出生前胎盘与附着处分离，创伤是需要考虑它的情境之一。

00:07:34.656 --> 00:07:49.056
Pain, uterine tenderness, contractions or vaginal bleeding may raise concern, but the pattern varies. Do not require a rigid abdomen and a large visible bleed before taking the problem seriously.
疼痛、子宫压痛、宫缩或阴道出血可引担忧，但模式有差异。不能等到板状腹及大量可见血才认真处理。

00:07:49.056 --> 00:08:00.888
Blood may be concealed, and maternal compensation can make early pressure appear reassuring. Estimate observed loss honestly without pretending to measure hidden internal loss.
血可能隐匿，母体代偿可使早期血压看似放心。需如实估可见失血，不能假装测到了内部隐匿量。

00:08:00.888 --> 00:08:13.104
Field assessment cannot reliably exclude placental separation. Continue maternal care, appropriate conveyance and early notification rather than offer clearance from one normal finding.
现场评估不能可靠排胎盘分离。需继续母体照护、适当转运及预警，不用一项正常发现作排除保证。

00:08:13.104 --> 00:08:25.488
A large uterus can compress major vessels when the patient lies flat. Reduced venous return lowers cardiac filling and can contribute to dizziness, hypotension and impaired perfusion.
较大子宫平躺时可压大血管，减少静脉回流及心充盈，造成头晕、低压及灌注受损。

00:08:25.488 --> 00:08:35.880
This mechanism can coexist with hemorrhage or another cause of shock. Improvement after repositioning does not prove there is no injury or ongoing blood loss.
此机制可与出血或其他休克原因并存。换位后改善，不证明无伤或无持续失血。

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:48.984
Consider uterine relief in the appropriate later-pregnancy setting while preserving airway and injury care. The aim is useful circulation, not achieving a memorized tilt angle at any cost.
适当晚孕情境应考虑解除子宫压迫，同时保气道与伤情照护。目标是有效循环，不是不惜代价达到背诵角度。

00:08:48.984 --> 00:09:00.504
Repeat symptoms, perfusion and reliable measurements after the modification. Treat the effect as information for the whole assessment rather than a definitive diagnostic test.
调整后需复查症状、灌注及可靠测量。应把效果作为整体评估信息，而不是确定诊断试验。

00:09:00.504 --> 00:09:09.840
The school uses a fundus near the umbilicus as an approximate twenty-week landmark. It can help when the patient cannot provide a reliable history.
学校把宫底接近脐作为约二十周标志，在患者不能提供可靠病史时可帮助判断。

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:21.048
It is not a precise dating test or proof of fetal maturity, viability or birth weight. Multiple gestation, body habitus and other factors can alter the finding.
它不是精确定孕周检查，也不证明胎成熟、可生存或出生体重。多胎、体型及其他因素可改变发现。

00:09:21.048 --> 00:09:33.312
Use the landmark to anticipate compression and appropriate resuscitation modifications. Do not delay life-saving care while repeatedly trying to establish an exact week by palpation.
应利用标志预判压迫及适当复苏调整。不能为反复触诊求准确孕周而延误救命照护。

00:09:33.312 --> 00:09:43.800
Record the reported gestation and the observed landmark as separate information. Label their sources and uncertainty so the next team can interpret them correctly.
转述孕周与所见标志需分别记录，并标来源及不确定，使接收方可正确解释。

00:09:43.800 --> 00:09:56.400
For a patient with circulation, a supported left-lateral position or left uterine displacement can reduce compression. Choose the method that is feasible and compatible with the clinical situation.
有循环者可用支撑左侧位或左移子宫减压。应选择可行且符合临床情境的方法。

00:09:56.400 --> 00:10:09.504
In trauma, preserve indicated spinal motion restriction and secure support while adapting position. Avoid an unstable tilted platform or forcing a position that obstructs necessary care.
创伤时需在调整中保适应性脊柱活动限制及稳定支撑。避免不稳倾斜平台或强迫妨碍必要照护的体位。

00:10:09.504 --> 00:10:20.184
Manual displacement is distinct from compressing or massaging the pregnant uterus. It is a positioning intervention taught and practised with appropriate supervision.
手法移位不同于挤压或按摩妊娠子宫，属于需适当监督教学练习的体位干预。

00:10:20.184 --> 00:10:30.408
Check the effect and maintain safe restraint during conveyance. Do not assume one initial position will remain effective after every transfer or change in condition.
需核效果，并在转运时保持安全固定。不能假定初始体位经每次转移及病情变化后都仍有效。

00:10:30.408 --> 00:10:45.672
Do not transfer the non-arrest tilt rule unchanged into cardiac arrest. Current AHA pregnancy-arrest guidance supports supine high-quality CPR with manual left uterine displacement when the fundus is at or above the umbilicus.
不能把非骤停倾斜规则原样搬入骤停。现行AHA妊娠骤停指导支持仰卧高质量CPR，并在宫底达脐或以上时手法左移子宫。

00:10:45.672 --> 00:10:57.240
Preserve effective compressions, defibrillation when indicated and airway support. Positioning should reduce compression without sacrificing the quality of the resuscitation itself.
需保持有效按压、有适应证除颤及气道支持。摆位应减压，而不能牺牲复苏本身质量。

00:10:57.240 --> 00:11:08.976
Request appropriate advanced and obstetric resources immediately and communicate pregnancy size and timing. Local destination and consultation requirements still apply.
需立即请求适当高级及产科资源，并交接子宫大小与时间。当地目的地及会诊要求仍适用。

00:11:08.976 --> 00:11:21.504
Resuscitative delivery is a specialist team intervention, not a new PCP surgical permission. This lecture does not resolve every local maternal-arrest logistics decision from a general guideline.
复苏性分娩是专业团队干预，不产生PCP手术权限。本课不能凭一般指南解决所有当地母体骤停后勤决定。

00:11:21.504 --> 00:11:32.688
Seven E repeatedly says high-flow oxygen even with a normal saturation. Do not extend that into one rule for every stable pregnant patient with any complaint.
7E反复说血氧正常也高流量氧，不能把它扩展为所有稳定孕妇任何主诉都一律如此。

00:11:32.688 --> 00:11:48.336
Current L ten pregnancy-trauma text specifies maternal saturation above ninety-five percent, with airway and oxygen support as required. Use the condition-specific pathway rather than silently replace it with a generic target.
现行L10妊娠创伤正文指定母体血氧高于九十五，并按需气道给氧。应使用病情特定路径，不能悄悄换成一般目标。

00:11:48.336 --> 00:12:02.928
A zero seven separately lists cord prolapse, shoulder dystocia and postpartum hemorrhage among high-flow exceptions regardless of saturation. Those specific indications are not a license to generalize to all pregnancy.
A07另把脐带脱垂、肩难产及产后出血列为不论血氧的高流量例外。这些具体适应证不授权推广到所有妊娠。

00:12:02.928 --> 00:12:15.168
Never withhold required rescue support, and do not confuse a saturation target with adequate ventilation or perfusion. Reassess the actual patient after oxygen or airway care.
不能扣住所需救援支持，也不能把血氧目标当充分通气灌注。给氧或气道照护后需复评本人。

00:12:15.168 --> 00:12:26.736
Ask whether movement is usual and when it was last felt, taking gestation into account. A report of reduced movement is meaningful even without a field fetal monitor.
需结合孕期问胎动是否如常及末次感觉时间。即使现场无胎监，减少报告仍有意义。

00:12:26.736 --> 00:12:41.976
A normal maternal monitor value or a report of movement does not exclude placental injury or fetal compromise. Conversely, an inability to feel movement early in pregnancy is not the same finding as a new late-pregnancy reduction.
母体监测正常或仍有胎动，不能排胎盘伤或胎儿受损。反过来，早孕尚感觉不到，不等同晚孕新减少。

00:12:41.976 --> 00:12:54.000
Use fetal observations when appropriate equipment and training are available, but never delay effective maternal resuscitation, urgent conveyance or necessary notification to obtain them.
有合适器械训练时可用胎儿观察，但不能为取得它而延误有效母体复苏、急转运或必要预警。

00:12:54.000 --> 00:13:04.776
Communicate the reported change and its timing without claiming a fetal diagnosis you cannot establish. The receiving obstetric team needs the full context.
应交接转述变化及时间，不声称无法证实胎儿诊断。接收产科团队需要完整背景。

00:13:04.776 --> 00:13:15.744
Current L ten includes interventions intended for several provider levels. Read the operational level and the linked procedure, not only the general-information paragraph.
现行L10含面向多个层级的干预。需读操作层级及所链程序，不只读一般信息段。

00:13:15.744 --> 00:13:27.408
PCP access and fluid decisions remain indication-based and require reassessment. Do not turn the pregnancy blood-volume expansion into a blanket large-volume fluid prescription.
PCP通路及液体决定仍需适应证与复评。不能把妊娠血容量增加变成一律大量补液处方。

00:13:27.408 --> 00:13:40.920
L ten requires consultation before tranexamic acid for the relevant hemorrhagic-shock context. Confirm the current monograph and patient conditions rather than copy a remembered trauma dose without checking.
L10在相关失血休克情境要求TXA前会诊。需核现行药物条目及条件，不能不查就抄记忆创伤剂量。

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:54.192
Nasogastric insertion, thoracostomy, blood products and surgery are not new PCP permissions merely because they appear on the page. Arrange appropriately trained resources and definitive care.
页面出现胃管、胸管、血制品及手术，不会自动产生PCP新权限。应安排适当训练资源及明确治疗。

00:13:54.192 --> 00:14:08.160
The severity of maternal injury and the need for immediate resuscitation drive destination planning. A patient with major trauma should not be diverted from appropriate trauma care solely because a maternity unit exists elsewhere.
母体伤重及即时复苏需求决定目的地计划。重大创伤不能只因别处有产科，就偏离适当创伤照护。

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:22.368
When severity or gestation is uncertain, seek the appropriate emergency and trauma assessment through the local pathway. Do not use a rough fundal landmark to make an unsupported viability or hospital-capability decision.
伤重或孕期不确定时，需依当地路径寻适当急诊创伤评估。不能凭粗宫底标志作无依据可生存或医院能力决定。

00:14:22.368 --> 00:14:36.264
Pre-alert with injury mechanism, estimated gestation, symptoms, physiological trend and care. Include suspected obstetric complications without converting suspicion into a confirmed diagnosis.
需以机制、估孕周、症状、生理趋势及照护预警。可报疑产科并发，但不能把怀疑变确诊。

00:14:36.264 --> 00:14:47.808
Use consultation when the destination or coordination is unclear. Continue useful care while the route is arranged and reassess whether new deterioration changes urgency.
目的地或协调不清时应会诊。安排路线时仍持续有效照护，并复评新恶化是否改变紧迫。

00:14:47.808 --> 00:15:00.984
The selected ISSHP framework defines pregnancy hypertension at systolic one hundred forty or diastolic ninety or higher, with severe range at one hundred sixty or one hundred ten or higher.
所选ISSHP框架以收缩一百四十或舒张九十及以上定义妊娠高血压，严重范围为一百六十或一百一十及以上。

00:15:00.984 --> 00:15:13.128
The word or matters: both numbers do not have to cross the threshold. Use a suitable cuff, correct technique and an appropriate repeat rather than accept a doubtful single reading.
或字重要，不必两项都跨阈值。需用合适袖带、正确技术及适当重复，不能接受存疑单次值。

00:15:13.128 --> 00:15:24.960
Diagnostic confirmation intervals are not orders to remain on scene for hours with severe symptoms. Assess threats, repeat promptly when appropriate and organize urgent care.
诊断确认间隔不是要求有严重症状者在现场等数小时。需评威胁、适当及时重复，并组织急照护。

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:39.072
A relative rise below the threshold can still accompany important illness, but it does not by itself establish preeclampsia. Symptoms and organ involvement require evaluation rather than a new invented cutoff.
低于阈值的相对上升仍可伴重要疾病，但本身不能确诊先兆子痫。症状及器官受累需评估，而非另造阈值。

00:15:39.072 --> 00:15:54.576
Preeclampsia typically involves new hypertension after twenty weeks with qualifying maternal organ or uteroplacental dysfunction. Proteinuria is one possible feature, not an obligatory finding in every modern diagnostic pathway.
先兆子痫通常涉及二十周后新高血压及符合条件的母体器官或子宫胎盘功能异常。蛋白尿是可能特征，不是现代每条诊断路径都必需。

00:15:54.576 --> 00:16:05.352
Ask about severe or persistent headache, visual changes and upper-abdominal pain. These should not automatically be dismissed as normal pregnancy discomfort.
应问严重或持续头痛、视觉变及上腹痛，不能自动归为正常孕期不适。

00:16:05.352 --> 00:16:19.512
New dyspnea, reduced responsiveness or evidence of organ dysfunction increases concern. HELLP names hemolysis, elevated liver enzymes and low platelets; it cannot be confirmed from abdominal pain alone.
新气促、反应低或器官异常证据增担忧。HELLP指溶血、肝酶升及血小板低，不能只凭腹痛确诊。

00:16:19.512 --> 00:16:32.952
Sudden swelling can contribute to the story, but swelling alone does not diagnose the syndrome and its absence does not exclude it. Field recognition should lead to timely evaluation, not false certainty.
突然水肿可补充故事，但单独不确诊，缺水肿也不排。现场识别应导及时评估，而非虚假确定。

00:16:32.952 --> 00:16:45.984
The school lists first pregnancy, prior hypertension, kidney disease, diabetes and multiple fetuses as risk contexts. Ask about these without assuming that the syndrome is limited to one group.
学校列首次妊娠、既往高压、肾病、糖尿病及多胎等风险背景。应询问，但不能假定疾病只发生于某组。

00:16:45.984 --> 00:16:58.272
A previous complicated pregnancy or new concern in prenatal care is important to communicate. Attribute the report and distinguish a documented finding from a patient's recollection.
既往复杂孕史或产检新担忧需交接，并标来源，区分已记录发现与本人回忆。

00:16:58.272 --> 00:17:08.520
No known risk factors and a normal earlier visit do not exclude disease today. The current symptom pattern and physiological findings still require assessment.
无已知风险、先前产检正常，都不能排今天疾病。当前症状模式及生理发现仍需评估。

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:18.312
Do not frame risk discussion as blame. The useful question is what the history changes about suspicion, monitoring, urgency and communication.
风险讨论不能变责备。有用问题是病史如何改变怀疑、监测、紧迫及沟通。

00:17:18.312 --> 00:17:32.304
Eclampsia involves a seizure in the relevant hypertensive pregnancy syndrome, but the first recognized event may be the seizure itself. A previous diagnosis of preeclampsia is not required before considering it.
子痫涉及相关妊娠高血压综合征中的抽搐，但首次被识别事件可能就是抽搐。考虑它不要求先有先兆子痫诊断。

00:17:32.304 --> 00:17:43.560
Headache or visual symptoms may precede the event, but their absence is not reassuring enough to exclude it. Postpartum presentation also remains possible.
头痛或视觉症可先出现，但缺乏这些不足以放心排除，产后也仍可能发生。

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:58.992
The school wording that pregnancy seizures are most often eclampsia should not close the differential. Hypoglycemia, epilepsy, intracranial disease, toxicity and other causes can coexist or present similarly.
学校所说妊娠抽搐多数为子痫，不能用于封闭鉴别。低血糖、癫痫、颅内病、毒物等可并存或相似。

00:17:58.992 --> 00:18:10.224
Treat immediate threats and follow the applicable seizure and obstetric pathway. Do not wait for a urine test or a second classic feature before initiating urgent support.
需处理即时威胁，并依适用抽搐产科路径。不能等尿检或第二经典特征才开始急支持。

00:18:10.224 --> 00:18:21.120
Protect from injury without forcing the limbs or placing anything in the mouth. Track seizure timing and assess breathing and responsiveness as soon as feasible.
应防伤，但不强制固定肢体或塞口。需计抽搐时间，并尽快评呼吸反应。

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:32.328
Support airway and ventilation and check glucose when appropriate without delaying essential care. Use safe positioning compatible with pregnancy and any injury.
需支持气道通气，适当查糖但不延误必要照护，并采用符合妊娠及伤情的安全体位。

00:18:32.328 --> 00:18:44.424
Magnesium and other advanced medicines are not automatically PCP interventions because they are discussed in the school lesson. Follow the actual service role and consultation requirements.
学校讨论硫酸镁等高级药，不使它自动成为PCP干预。需依真实服务层级及会诊要求。

00:18:44.424 --> 00:18:55.848
Fluid decisions also need caution in suspected preeclampsia because pulmonary edema can occur. Do not treat every altered pregnant patient with an automatic large bolus.
疑先兆子痫时液体也需谨慎，因为可肺水肿。不能所有妊娠意识变都自动大量冲液。

00:18:55.848 --> 00:19:09.840
Ask about onset, amount observed, clots, pain and associated fluid loss or contractions. Use the patient's account and objective observations without assuming external blood equals total loss.
需问起始、可见量、血块、疼痛及伴随流液宫缩，并结合本人陈述及客观观察，不认外血等于总失血。

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:21.792
Gestation changes the possibilities, including early pregnancy loss or ectopic disease and later placental causes. Bleeding pattern alone does not definitively identify the source.
孕期改变可能性，包括早孕丢失或异位及晚期胎盘原因。出血模式本身不能确定来源。

00:19:21.792 --> 00:19:36.000
Do not perform a routine internal digital vaginal examination to find the cause or estimate dilation. Necessary authorized external observation for imminent delivery is a different task with explanation and privacy.
不能常规内指检找原因或估开指。为即将分娩做必要授权外观观察，是不同任务，仍需解释隐私。

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:47.640
Assess shock and provide the indicated urgent plan. A small observed amount can still accompany a serious problem, while not every spotting episode proves catastrophic hemorrhage.
需评休克并提供所需急计划。少量可见血仍可伴重问题，但也不是每次点滴血都证明灾难性大出血。

00:19:47.640 --> 00:20:17.424
Consider an original patient at thirty-two weeks with painless vaginal bleeding who is becoming faint. Do not call this mild simply because the abdomen is not painful. Begin the primary assessment and assess perfusion while your partner arranges the urgent plan. Ask about the bleeding and its trend, estimated gestation, previous pregnancies and uterine surgery without delaying essential care. Do not use an internal examination to settle the cause.
考虑原创患者：孕32周，无痛阴道出血，越来越晕厥。不能仅因腹部不痛就称轻微。应开始初级评估、检查灌注，同时由伙伴安排紧急计划。询问出血及趋势、估计孕周、既往妊娠及子宫手术史，但不延误必要照护。不能用内部检查来确定原因。

00:20:17.424 --> 00:20:50.664
Current L zero six treats serious late-pregnancy bleeding as an obstetric emergency, including possible previa, abruption, rupture or fetal-vessel bleeding. Communicate the findings and trajectory to the appropriate receiving team early, maintain indicated support and reassess during conveyance. Visible blood is not a reliable measure of all blood lost. Follow the current position, treatment and consultation requirements for your actual role; the old video is not a medication order.
现行L06将严重晚孕出血视为产科急症，可能包括前置胎盘、早剥、破裂或胎儿血管出血。应尽早向适当接收团队传达发现及趋势，维持有指征支持，并在运输中复评。可见血量不能可靠代表全部失血。应依实际角色现行体位、治疗及咨询要求，旧视频不是药物医嘱。

00:20:50.664 --> 00:21:02.592
Sudden, severe, persistent or worsening abdominal pain needs careful assessment. Do not call it normal contractions without examining the timeline and associated findings.
突然、严重、持续或加重腹痛需仔细评估。不能不查时间线及伴随发现就称正常宫缩。

00:21:02.592 --> 00:21:16.152
Ask whether pain is intermittent or constant, where it began, and whether bleeding, contractions, fluid loss, syncope or trauma is present. Prior uterine surgery is relevant history.
需问间歇还是持续、起始部位，以及出血、宫缩、流液、晕厥或创伤，并关注既往子宫手术。

00:21:16.152 --> 00:21:27.048
Pregnancy does not prevent appendiceal, renal, gastrointestinal, vascular or other disease. Keep plausible alternatives visible while treating maternal threats.
妊娠不妨碍发生阑尾、肾、胃肠、血管等疾病。处理母体威胁时仍需保留合理替代。

00:21:27.048 --> 00:21:40.368
No single pain location or field maneuver definitively confirms uterine rupture or excludes concealed bleeding. Describe findings and obtain timely definitive care rather than overstate certainty.
单个痛位或现场手法不能确诊子宫破裂，也不能排隐匿出血。需描述发现并及时明确照护，不夸大确定性。

00:21:40.368 --> 00:21:52.008
Ask what movement is usual at this gestation and what has changed. A new reduction after movement is established is different from not yet perceiving movement early in pregnancy.
需问该孕期平时胎动及变化。已建立胎动后新减少，与早孕尚未感觉到不同。

00:21:52.008 --> 00:22:05.208
Record when normal activity was last perceived and associated pain, bleeding or trauma. Do not invent a universal count or use an unvalidated short field observation to clear the concern.
需记末次正常感觉及伴痛、出血或创伤。不能另造通用计数，或用未经验证短现场观察排担忧。

00:22:05.208 --> 00:22:17.160
Maternal primary assessment remains essential. Maternal illness may affect the fetus, while a reassuring maternal pressure or pulse does not prove normal fetal status.
母体主要评估仍必要。母体病可影响胎儿，而放心的母体血压脉搏不证明胎儿正常。

00:22:17.160 --> 00:22:28.104
Arrange the appropriate timely maternity evaluation and communicate the reported change. Do not delay indicated care while trying repeatedly to provoke movement.
需安排适当及时产科评估并交接变化报告，不能反复试图诱发胎动而延误所需照护。

00:22:28.104 --> 00:22:38.304
Ask about a recent birth or pregnancy loss even without a visible pregnancy. Record the date and relevant complications, medicines and recovery.
即使无可见妊娠，也需问近期分娩或妊娠丢失，并记录日期、相关并发、药物及恢复。

00:22:38.304 --> 00:22:49.416
Hypertensive neurological illness and serious bleeding can present after birth. A previous uncomplicated discharge does not guarantee that the current symptom is benign.
高血压神经疾病及严重出血可在出生后出现。之前顺利出院，不保证当前症状良性。

00:22:49.416 --> 00:23:01.200
New dyspnea, chest pain, syncope, fever, focal weakness or altered state also needs a broad assessment. Avoid attributing everything to exhaustion or normal recovery.
新气促、胸痛、晕厥、热、局灶弱或意识变也需广评，不能全归疲劳或正常恢复。

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:12.000
Communicate postpartum status with the symptom timeline and current findings. It changes the context without making one pregnancy-related diagnosis inevitable.
需把产后状态、症时间线及当前发现一起交接。它改变背景，却不使某个孕相关诊断成为必然。

00:23:12.000 --> 00:23:22.824
Introduce yourself and explain the immediate concern in plain language. Describe what you need to assess and why before touching or exposing a sensitive area.
需自我介绍，并以清楚语言解释即时担忧。触碰或暴露敏感部位前，应说需查什么及理由。

00:23:22.824 --> 00:23:35.184
Seek appropriate consent and involve the patient in decisions whenever possible. Pregnancy does not automatically remove decision-making capacity or allow a partner to overrule the patient.
应取得适当同意，并尽可能让本人参与。妊娠不会自动取消决策能力，也不允许伴侣直接推翻本人。

00:23:35.184 --> 00:23:45.864
Ask whether the patient wants a support person present and use suitable language assistance. Family presence may help, but it should not prevent private communication when needed.
需问是否希望支持者在场，并用适当语言协助。家人可帮助，但不能阻止必要私下沟通。

00:23:45.864 --> 00:23:57.816
Use covering, barriers and the smallest necessary audience. Explain unavoidable urgency without threats, judgment or a promise of an outcome you cannot guarantee.
需覆盖、屏障并尽量减少旁观者。应解释无法避免的紧迫，不威胁、评判或保证无法承诺结局。

00:23:57.816 --> 00:24:09.360
Trauma can involve intimate-partner or other violence. Seek a safe opportunity for private conversation rather than ask sensitive questions in front of a possible source of harm.
创伤可能涉及伴侣或其他暴力。应找安全私谈机会，而非在可能伤害来源面前问敏感问题。

00:24:09.360 --> 00:24:22.416
Use neutral questions and explain relevant confidentiality limits accurately. Do not promise absolute secrecy, investigate beyond your role or assume that a particular injury proves a perpetrator.
需中性提问，并准确解释保密限制。不能承诺绝对秘密、越权调查或认某伤证明某人施害。

00:24:22.416 --> 00:24:33.024
Record what the patient says with attribution and describe objective observations. A concern, an allegation and a confirmed fact are different categories.
需标来源记本人话并描述客观观察。担忧、指控及已证事实属于不同类别。

00:24:33.024 --> 00:24:45.048
Address immediate safety and use the appropriate consent and safeguarding process. Preserve dignity while arranging medical care and the resources the actual situation requires.
需处理即时安全，并用适当同意及保护程序。在安排医疗与所需资源时保持尊严。

00:24:45.048 --> 00:24:55.968
This original example is separate from the school imminent-delivery case. A patient reports an estimated twenty-nine-week pregnancy and a low-speed restrained collision.
这个原创例不同于学校即将分娩病例。患者报告估二十九周妊娠及低速系安全带碰撞。

00:24:55.968 --> 00:25:08.664
They describe lower-abdominal belt pressure, new persistent pain, a small vaginal bleed and less movement than usual. The amount of external blood is not a measurement of internal loss.
本人描述下腹安全带压力、新持续痛、少量阴道血及胎动少于平时。外血量不是内部失血测量。

00:25:08.664 --> 00:25:18.840
Do not label the event harmless because the vehicle damage looks small or the patient walked after impact. Assess the actual mechanism and current maternal findings.
不能因车辆损小或撞后曾走就称无害。需评真实机制及当前母体发现。

00:25:18.840 --> 00:25:30.360
State concerns without announcing a confirmed placental diagnosis. The immediate plan is maternal assessment, appropriate support and timely trauma-obstetric coordination.
应说担忧，不宣布已确胎盘诊断。即时计划是母体评估、适当支持及及时创伤产科协调。

00:25:30.360 --> 00:25:43.152
Assume the patient is alert, with pulse one hundred four, pressure one hundred sixteen over seventy-two and respiratory rate twenty-two. A reliable room-air saturation is ninety-seven percent.
假设患者清醒，脉一百零四、压一百一十六比七十二、呼吸二十二，可靠室内空气血氧九十七。

00:25:43.152 --> 00:25:54.888
There is lower-abdominal tenderness but no major external injury found. These observations do not exclude concealed bleeding, placental separation or an evolving problem.
有下腹压痛，但未发现重大外伤。这些观察不能排隐匿出血、胎盘分离或发展中问题。

00:25:54.888 --> 00:26:07.752
Support an appropriate compression-aware position while preserving indicated injury care. Assess the whole patient, keep warm and obtain relevant repeated observations without an internal examination.
需支持合适减压体位，并保适应性伤照护。应评全人、保暖及取相关复测，不做内诊。

00:26:07.752 --> 00:26:20.808
Arrange the appropriate pathway and notification. Oxygen decisions follow current indications and the pregnancy-trauma target; this stable saturation does not itself prove fetal well-being.
需安排适当路径及预警。给氧依现行适应证及妊娠创伤目标；这个稳定血氧本身不证明胎儿健康。

00:26:20.808 --> 00:26:33.672
Now assume the patient becomes pale and lightheaded, pulse rises to one hundred twenty-four and pressure falls to ninety-two over fifty-eight. This is a meaningful change from the initial assessment.
现假设患者变苍白、头晕，脉升至一百二十四、压降至九十二比五十八。这是相对初评的重要变化。

00:26:33.672 --> 00:26:46.296
Repeat primary threats and consider bleeding, compression and other mechanisms together. Do not assume that uterine relief will necessarily solve the problem or that hidden loss can be quantified in the field.
需重查主要威胁，并综合出血、压迫及其他机制。不能假定移位必解决，也不能认现场可定量隐匿失血。

00:26:46.296 --> 00:27:00.408
Provide indicated authorized shock care, reassess response and escalate resources and destination planning. Any TXA or fluid decision must meet the actual current conditions and consultation requirements.
需提供所需授权休克照护、复查反应并升级资源及目的地。TXA或液体决定必须满足真实现行条件及会诊要求。

00:27:00.408 --> 00:27:12.984
Update the receiving team with the measured trend, pain, bleeding and reduced movement. Do not delay urgent conveyance for a complete fetal assessment or a definitive field diagnosis.
应更新接收方测量趋势、疼痛、出血及胎动少。不能为完整胎儿评估或现场确诊而延误急转运。

00:27:12.984 --> 00:27:24.696
Give estimated gestation and its source, relevant prior history and the exact mechanism. Separate the time of impact, symptom onset and any later deterioration.
需给估孕周及来源、相关既往史和准确机制，并分碰撞、症起及后续恶化时间。

00:27:24.696 --> 00:27:36.456
Report pain, visible or reported blood, fluid, contractions and movement concerns with attribution. Unknown placental or fetal status should remain unknown.
需标来源报疼痛、实见或转述血、流液、宫缩及胎动担忧。未知胎盘胎儿状态应仍未知。

00:27:36.456 --> 00:27:48.648
State maternal findings and how they changed, including reliable oxygenation and measurement limitations. One initial reassuring set must not conceal a later shock pattern.
需说母体发现及变化，包括可靠氧合与测量限制。不能用一组初始放心值遮后续休克模式。

00:27:48.648 --> 00:28:02.352
Explain positioning, airway, perfusion support and actual response, plus consultation and resource needs. The receiving team needs enough information to prepare appropriate trauma and obstetric care.
应解释体位、气道、灌注支持及真实反应，以及会诊资源需求，使接收方能备适当创伤产科照护。

00:28:02.352 --> 00:28:11.232
You should explain why pregnancy can hide early shock and complicate airway care without treating every abnormality as expected physiology.
应能解释妊娠为何可隐早休克及增加气道困难，但不能把所有异常当预期生理。

00:28:11.232 --> 00:28:24.168
Recognize severe headache, visual change, upper pain, seizure, bleeding, reduced movement and altered state as reasons for appropriate urgent assessment, not as proof of one diagnosis.
需识别重头痛、视觉变、上腹痛、抽搐、出血、胎动少及意识变，作为适当急评理由，而非某诊断证明。

00:28:24.168 --> 00:28:33.552
Keep compression relief in a patient with circulation separate from supine high-quality maternal CPR and from the newborn transition algorithm taught next.
应把有循环者减压，与仰卧高质量母体CPR及接下来新生儿过渡算法分开。

00:28:33.552 --> 00:28:47.208
In practice, show consent, privacy, useful history, accurate trend and timely communication. These skills connect the physiological teaching to the school delivery and neonatal objectives.
练习中应展示同意、隐私、有用病史、准确趋势及及时沟通，使生理教学连到学校分娩新生儿目标。
